    nyiso_seam_par_attribution: { cell: "K", ev: "nyiso-157 (2026-08-30) — CELL R -> K, RE-TESTED AND PROMOTED at the nyiso-155 HEAD under the 2026-08-30 owner ruling (INTAKE-SPEC-nyiso156 Leg 1; DO-NOT-REDO satisfied: the ruling postdates the R and the nyiso-128/129 solar-basis repair moved the exact K3 quantity — K3 does NOT re-fire, C1 14/14 free 10/10 both arms). KEEPER 2026-08-30-nyiso-157-par-attribution vs same-HEAD control 2026-08-30-nyiso-157-par-control; every standing kill gate silent (_nyiso157_par_ab_gates.json); P1 confirmed, P3 confirmed (C3a-2025 -10.8 -> -12.0, never predicted to close); C3b-2025 0.197 -> 0.203 knife-edge crossing, owner-accepted; promotion on rules 14+1 by owner ruling (keeper shard promotion_note). PRIOR (nyiso-127) REJECTION RECORD PRESERVED: results/calibration/PREREG-nyiso126-eastern-seam-attribution-2026-08-04.md + PREREG-nyiso127-addendum-eastern-seam-availability-source-2026-08-05.md + PREREG-nyiso127-addendum2-full-seam-attribution-2026-08-05.md; probe scripts/probes/_nyiso127_par_phase0.py; record results/calibration/_nyiso127_par_phase0.json; intake data/raw/NYISO/par-data/" },
